yin":"rán","traditional":"然","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"贯","pinyin":"guàn","traditional":"貫","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"tōng","traditional":"通","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yān","traditional":"焉","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"modern":"则","pinyin":"zé","traditional":"則","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"众","pinyin":"zhòng","traditional":"眾","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"wù","traditional":"物","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"biǎo","traditional":"表","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"里","pinyin":"lǐ","traditional":"裡","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jīng","traditional":"精","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"cū","traditional":"粗","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"无","pinyin":"wú","traditional":"無","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dào","traditional":"到","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"wú","traditional":"吾","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xīn","traditional":"心","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"quán","traditional":"全","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"体","pinyin":"tǐ","traditional":"體","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dà","traditional":"大","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yòng","traditional":"用","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"无","pinyin":"wú","traditional":"無","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"míng","traditional":"明","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"矣","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"cǐ","traditional":"此","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"谓","pinyin":"wèi","traditional":"謂","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"wù","traditional":"物","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"gé","traditional":"格","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"cǐ","traditional":"此","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"谓","pinyin":"wèi","traditional":"謂","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"知","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhì","traditional":"至","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yě","traditional":"也","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Demikianlah yang dinamai mengetahui pangkal dan demikian pulalah yang dinamai memperoleh pengetahuan yang sempurna. (Bab V yang menerangkan hal 'meneliti hakekat tiap perkara' ini sudah hilang, maka disini dipetikkan buah tulisan Chengzi - Thiacu yang boleh menggantikan bagian itu. \"Adapun yang dinamai meluaskan pengetahuan dengan meneliti hakekat tiap perkara itu ialah: Bila kita hendak meluaskan pengetahuan, kita harus meneliti Hukum (Li) sembarang hal sampai sedalam-dalamnya. Oleh karena manusia itu mempunyai kekuatan bathin, sudah selayaknya tidak ada hal yang tidak dapat diketahui; selain itu juga karena tiap hal di dunia ini sudah mempunyai Hukum tertentu. Tetapi kalau kita belum dapat mengetahui Hukum itu sedalam- dalamnya, itulah karena kita belum sekuat tenaga menggunakan kecerdasan. Maka Kitab Da Xue - Thai Hak ini mula-mula mengajarkan kita yang hendak belajar, supaya dapat menyelami dalam- dalam segala hal ihwal di dunia ini. Seorang yang mempunyai pengetahuan Hukum itu sedalam- dalamnya, akan menjadikan ia sanggup mencapai puncak kesempurnaan. Bila kita dengan sepenuh tenaga mempelajarinya, niscaya pada suatu pagi walaupun mungkin lama kita akan memperoleh kesadaran bathin yang menjalin dan menembusi segala-galanya. Disitu akan kita lihat semuanya luar dan dalam, halus dan kasar sehingga tiada suatupun yang tidak terjangkau. Demikianlah bathin kita telah sepenuhnya digunakan sehingga tiada sesuatu yang tidak terang. Demikianlah yang dinamai mengetahui pangkal, dan demikianlah pula yang dinamai memperoleh pengetahuan yang sempurna.\")"}],"source_file":"01 - Da Xue 大學/06 - Bab V - Meneliti Hakekat Tiap Perkara.md","title":"Bab V — Meneliti Hakekat Tiap Perkara"}
